{"id":"o6is9ayyi78g2bun9076agag0","title":"书法四快四慢口诀解析","originalTitle":"孙过庭《书谱》 书法四快四慢","summary":"这一教学口诀源于当代书法培训，强调楷书和行书中的笔画节奏。横慢竖快、撇快捺慢等规则帮助练习者通过调整笔画速度来提升书写美感。练习时，通过节拍器或心理默数，让手形成肌肉记忆，每天挑选包含这些笔画的字进行慢写练习，以体会节奏变化。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=280034&do=blog&id=1560179"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T01:25:31.454Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T01:25:31.454Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表"],"score":25,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}